       sentence (~345px) lost its tail ("در رزرو آنلاین") at 320/390px —
       measured: span.scrollWidth 345 vs clientWidth 189/259. Let the message
       wrap and let the row wrap so the booking pill can never force the strip
       wider than the viewport. Page-scoped: no shared stylesheet or layout
       file is touched. */
    :global(.announcement-strip .announcement-inner) {
